WEBVTT

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:36.550
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.320
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.100
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.830
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.540
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.120
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.330
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.660
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.270
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.040
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.730
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.510
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.230
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.840
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.490
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:17.360
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.080
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.760
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.370
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.140
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.600
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.490
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.800
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:36.950
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:48.330
Good morning!

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:49.270
Morning!

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:52.070
The sun feels so delightfully warm.

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:54.520
It looks like it's going to be a peaceful day.

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:56.110
Yeah.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:02.180
I've been worried about the X that appeared on Dia,

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.990
but we've got the Guardians all settled now, so...

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:08.100
Is something wrong, Amu-chan?

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.050
No, nothing.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:11.850
Let's work hard again today!

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:13.150
Yeah!

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:18.890
Um, I have some news for you.

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:22.890
Our class will be getting an exchange student!

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:24.630
An exchange student?

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:28.890
He comes from a far-off country, and will be studying with you all for a while.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.140
What?

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.140
What's that?

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:28.890
Hm?

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:31.930
What?

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.340
Wh-What's that?

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:46.820
What a surprise!

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:49.320
I can't believe he arrived by helicopter.

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:51.640
Who did? No way! The exchange student?

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:55.050
I heard about this new student as well.

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:59.210
He's a mind-bogglingly wealthy prince from a far-off land.

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:02.470
A prince! You mean a <i>real</i> one?

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:03.850
Uh-oh.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:07.100
Don't call me a prince!

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:09.930
Three, two, one!

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:11.750
He's back to normal!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:12.660
Nice, Rima!

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:15.520
Hey, look at that.

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:16.430
The hatch is opening.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.430
A tiger!

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.520
Take it easy, Ginger.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.400
He's so cool!

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.140
He's great!

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.830
Look, Amu.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:36.850
Is that...

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:38.560
A Guardian Character?

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:45.710
The Golden Prince has arrived at last.

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:49.380
So this is Seiyo Academy.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:51.060
I'm definitely going to find it here!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.830
The Golden Prince! Part One.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.830
Episode 36

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.690
Those are rose petals!

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:07.320
Rose petals?

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.120
That's gold dust.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.180
G-Gold dust?

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.720
It's gorgeous!

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:18.680
Beautiful girls, receive the proof that you have been near me.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:24.980
Oh!

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.160
I wonder what it is.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:31.850
Thank you for coming all this way, and welcome to Seiyo Academy.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:36.340
You are the King's Chair of the Guardians, Hotori Tadase, correct?

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:39.810
Just as I heard, you are a Character Bearer, yourself.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:41.560
Yes, Shuraiya-sama.

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:44.150
Just "Shuraiya" is fine.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:44.940
Of course.

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:48.770
It's super royal!

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:50.970
A dreamy double shot!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.080
Yeah, it's kind of...

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:58.060
If possible, I will search for my future queen at this school.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.060
His queen?

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:04.930
But that is a secret, as I am travelling incognito here in Japan.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.820
Oh, that was rude of me.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:11.570
How is this incognito?

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.790
Emergency meeting in progress!  No eavesdropping!

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:14.300
Listen.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.220
A chance like this doesn't even come once in a hundred years.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.430
{05:26} Queen Candidate

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:22.430
I, Yamabuki Saya, will be chosen as Shuraiya-sama's queen!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:25.100
And all of you will support me to the fullest!

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.520
Yes, Saya-sama!

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:29.020
If I'm chosen to be his queen...

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:33.450
I'll have riches to my heart's content!

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:36.510
Hey, Saya! Come on, Saya!

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:37.140
Days spent holding magnificent parties with the world's celebrities at our luxurious palace!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:41.640
I'll take it! He'll be a miraculous catch!

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:47.970
Intrigue is always swirling around the toilet.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:51.630
Amu-chan, eavesdropping is bad.

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.620
I <i>want</i> to leave, but I can't.

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:58.430
It's time for gym!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:05.730
Man, I'm tired.

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:07.100
I can't take it anymore.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:11.670
It's okay, it's okay! Let's all do our best!

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:15.140
It's impossible. Nobody could, in this heat.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:22.780
Oh my, this is the first time I've tasted juice from a can.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:25.290
Is it to your liking?

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:27.560
You are the ones who prepared it, are you not?

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:28.960
I'm Yuka!

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:29.680
I'm Mika!

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:30.530
I'm Haruka!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.270
I'm Ayaka!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:36.340
As a reward, I will bequeath you a private beach in the south of France.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.420
The south of France!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.250
A private beach!

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:43.580
U-Um...

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.560
What will you give to me?

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:47.350
Let us see...

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:50.430
A kiss.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.630
A-A kiss?

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:05.250
Ginger loves to kiss girls!

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.240
Wait a second!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.560
Who are you?

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:12.690
Hinamori Amu. Other people are thirsty, but they don't get to drink.

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:15.600
There's no reason for just you to be drinking.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.440
Even if you're a prince,

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:23.840
at this school, you're just like the rest of us, so you should do things normally like everyone else.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:24.850
What?

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:26.560
That's our Amu-chan.

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:28.390
"Cool & spicy!"

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:30.840
Wait!

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.770
Are you lecturing <i>me</i>, Prince Shuraiya?

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:36.690
Sure, you're a prince,

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:38.100
but you're also a person like everyone else!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:45.470
She seems to be a strong-willed girl.

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:49.270
Impossible. Impossible.

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:49.270
That's not... It couldn't be...

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:50.610
An X Egg.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.490
Amu-chan!

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:52.100
Right!

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.540
Sensei, I have to go to the restroom.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.680
Okay, take your time!

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:59.670
Rima, shouldn't we go, too?

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:02.360
We can't. I can't run.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.930
Don't worry. Hinamori-san will take care of it.

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:08.330
Wait!

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.930
If I don't hurry up and take care of it...

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:14.600
People will think you take way too long in the bathroom!

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.160
People would get the wrong idea.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:18.500
Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.020
Yeah!

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:26.890
My heart:

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:28.270
Unlock!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.340
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:13.850
Heart Rod!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.220
Spiral Heart!

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:29.680
Gotcha.

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:32.440
Negative Heart:

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:35.810
Lock On!

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.140
Open Heart!

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:00.880
All right.

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:10.720
Is that...

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.600
It is indeed as you say.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.060
I apologize for earlier.

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:17.940
Huh?

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.270
Whoa! What?

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:23.410
I like you, Hinamori Amu.

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.490
Come to my country,

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:27.770
as its future queen.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:28.520
Huh?

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.270
What?

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.470
Oh no!

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:33.660
Saya-sama?

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:36.240
Saya-sama!

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:40.520
Ridiculous! You would turn down the throne of the queen?

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:43.160
Of course! I want to be normal!

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:44.770
I can't be a queen.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:47.090
I'll have a dress made for you.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:48.320
I don't want it!

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.360
I will build you a golden palace as well!

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:51.720
I said I don't want it!

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:53.450
You are so selfish!

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:54.740
So are you!

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:58.710
I'm not going to give up!

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:03.850
I've never met such a stubborn, selfish girl that had such promise!

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.550
Is he praising her?

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:06.430
In a strange way.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.900
Is that right?

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:10.780
This is your chance to be a disgustingly rich princess.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.090
It would be wonderful.

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:14.180
A marriage far above your station!

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:14.810
Shut up!

00:11:14.810 --> 00:11:17.600
Now now, calm down, Hinamori-san.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:20.310
Shuraiya, you calm down, too.

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.470
For a Guardian Character, he's quite steady.

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:26.460
I am called Lamila.

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:27.630
It is a pleasure.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:29.410
I am Kiseki.

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:34.600
Shuraiya-sama, isn't it about time to tell them the true reason for coming here?

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:37.850
The true reason?

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:43.100
I came to this school to search for the Embryo.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:55.120
You're looking for the Embryo?

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.600
That's your real reason for coming here?

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.120
That's right.

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:00.100
Pearl.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:00.600
Yes, Milord.

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:06.640
This is the diary that my father King Seomila wrote when he was a boy.

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:09.450
So he secretly read it?

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.880
And he even took it!

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:12.490
Unbelievable.

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:14.220
Silence! I can hear you!

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:17.710
When he was a child,

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:22.720
my father investigated the legend of the Embryo that was secretly spreading around the world.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:24.970
"The Embryo.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:28.120
The magic egg that can grant any wish.

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:32.220
In order to make my subjects happy, I must acquire that egg."

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:35.870
After a thorough investigation,

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:39.720
my father ascertained that there was a clue to be found at a certain Seiyo Academy in the Orient.

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.920
Thus, he became an exchange student here.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.850
But when two years passed without finding it, he returned to our country.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:56.980
According to my data, your father then ascended the throne at the age of 19.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:02.290
He is evidently a king of great courage and wisdom, beloved by all of his subjects.

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:05.750
A king of great courage and wisdom...

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.030
Beloved by all his subjects...

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.600
What a great dad!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.600
This has nothing to do with my father!

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:13.720
He failed.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:16.600
But I <i>will</i> find the Embryo.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.640
Is that clear? You, and you as well, will help me!

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:21.880
Commence a search for the Embryo immediately!

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:28.020
Well, shall we begin the meeting?

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:28.660
Yes.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.390
Let's take care of this quickly.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:32.860
Why are you ignoring me?

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:35.220
You're too selfish.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:35.540
{13:44} Selfish

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:36.810
Wh-What?!

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:37.950
Oh?

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:41.390
Next month is Shuraiya-dono's twelfth birthday.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:46.030
In Shuraiya-dono's country, it is customary for the King's oldest son

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:49.100
to assume the position of Crown Prince on his twelfth birthday.

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:51.600
What do you mean-dechu?

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:55.030
Next month, Shuraiya will officially become Crown Prince,

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:57.600
and there will be a national celebration.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.060
National...

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.380
Amazing!

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.350
Don't mention that.

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:04.850
It's irrelevant.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.170
What's wrong with him?

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:10.850
He's suddenly all mad.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:14.970
Based on the data, I can make no conjecture.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.080
The coronation ceremony has nothing to do with me!

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:27.350
Listen.

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:31.000
You are the one who will someday succeed me as King.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:35.890
You must begin to learn now what you will need to do to ensure the people's happiness.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:40.330
Every word from your mouth revolves around the happiness of the people.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:42.680
I have my own dreams!

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.270
Where are you going, Shuraiya?

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.430
I'm sick of being pushed around.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.140
Hello.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.850
It's been a while, Shuraiya.

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:02.890
You've been in my country before, haven't you?

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:07.630
I wanted to meet your father for a long time.

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.850
When I finally did, I was deeply impressed.

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:13.270
He's a wonderful king who lives up to his reputation.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:18.390
Your father must be worried about you.

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:22.140
I do not think so.

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:28.770
It's recess time.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.460
Here, this is important.

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:37.270
You carry it.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:39.970
You know how much I dislike my father.

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.680
The King is a very noble person;

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:45.060
never thinking of himself.

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:46.680
That's what's so irritating!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.910
Every time he sees me, he says-

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.890
"You must always devote yourself to the people."

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.580
What's so funny?

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.720
You've always been like that.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:06.650
Hinamori-sama?

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:11.180
Uh, um... I swear I wasn't eavesdropping.

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:14.570
This is just some random, super coincidence.

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.870
Um, you are...

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:18.890
I'm Pearl.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:22.720
It must be tough to be around such a moody prince.

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:27.510
Not at all. Though he does not look it, Shuraiya-sama is actually quite warm-hearted.

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:31.740
He is just embarrassed to reveal his true self.

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:34.100
In other words, he's just stubborn?

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:37.560
Yes. I've been with him since he was five years old.

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:47.380
Ginger! Stop that!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:49.750
Bad girl!

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:53.140
Uh, Pearl...

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:56.700
Are you a girl?

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:58.150
Yes.

00:16:58.150 --> 00:17:01.780
I dress in men's clothing because it allows me to move about more freely.

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:05.270
That way, I can be of more use to Shuraiya-sama.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.520
Pearl.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:11.220
What?

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:13.470
Are you saying you'll assist me?

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:16.360
Yes. It's been a while since we've met a fellow with backbone,

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:18.850
whose spirit burns with the desire to find the Embryo!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:22.460
Let us join forces and search for the Embryo together!

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:23.520
Well said!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.130
We'll help, too!

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:27.480
We've got nothing else to do.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.310
All right, let's give it our best!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.560
Yeah!

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.060
Yeah!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:40.470
Did you find any clues?

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:42.790
Does it look like we did?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.390
Don't be so impatient.

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:45.790
Right, right.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:48.390
It's the Embryo, so of course it won't be easy to find.

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:50.680
I wish to find it right now!

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:52.310
If you're not busy, lend us a hand!

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.200
Selfish

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:56.790
What is that look for?

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.560
This is...

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:02.180
Amu-chan's test!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.450
H-Hey!

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:06.100
65 points!

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.100
This is...

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.100
What?

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.600
Yaya-tan's test-dechu!

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:11.770
H-Hey!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.720
55 points!

00:18:13.720 --> 00:18:16.820
You... Quit mucking about!

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.600
Don't get mad.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:21.270
At times like this, just...

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:23.350
Bala-Balance!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:25.770
Yay! We did it!

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:28.080
Isn't anyone here reasonable?

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.270
I always wonder the same thing.

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.140
By the way...

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:36.890
If you did get the Embryo, what kind of wish would you make?

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:39.680
Yeah, yeah. You've already got everything.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.000
I am certainly interested in the answer.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:42.910
As am I.

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:44.430
I guess I'll hear what it is.

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.660
It should be obvious.

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:49.580
If I get the Embryo...

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:54.100
I'll wish for a dragon to be my servant, and we'll go to the demon world!

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.470
I'll slice the Demon King in two with a single stroke of my sword!

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:07.130
And then, I'll take all the girls in the world as my lovers!

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:09.600
Of course, Hinamori Amu, that includes you!

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:17.700
That seems kind of worthless.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:18.560
It's nonsense.

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:20.650
Let's go home.

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:21.800
W-Wait!

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:26.020
Anyway, I want to find the thing my father could not!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.140
I've got it!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:31.650
Shuraiya, the only reason you're searching for the Embryo

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:35.410
is because you want to do something that your father couldn't.

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:37.680
N-No.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:40.720
I see, so that's it.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.070
Anyway, about that Embryo...

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:46.010
Do you have any information on it?

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:51.210
The accursed Easter may have more detailed information than we.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:53.470
For example, Hoshina Utau might.

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:55.890
Hoshina Utau? Who is that?

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:58.600
Utau-chan is everyone's idol,

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:01.870
and she's also my true owner.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:04.350
Ah, I see.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:07.460
Well then, call this Hoshina Utau here.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:08.850
As if we could!

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.620
"Call Hoshina Utau here?"

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:17.600
Prince Shuraiya says some funny things.

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:21.170
He made me spend the whole day looking for the Embryo with him.

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:23.060
What is it?

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.930
I just hit on a nice idea!

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:29.780
Record today's soaps.

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:31.040
In high-quality mode?

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.090
Of course!

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:35.720
What sort of good idea could she have had?

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:40.100
Whenever your older sister looks happy, only trouble arises.

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:50.430
Well? Is it going to work out?

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:52.310
Of course, Yukari-senpai.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:58.390
I've exhausted the research possibilities with the data that Nikaidou left behind.

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:04.850
Utau? There's something I'd like you to do.

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:08.640
I think you'll enjoy it plenty, yourself.

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:20.000
Shuraiya, the only reason you're searching for the Embryo

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:23.720
is because you want to do something that your father couldn't.

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:26.950
Hinamori Amu,

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:29.080
you say only worrisome things.

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:38.520
Who are you?

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:47.350
A drop of night.

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:54.410
Th-That's...

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:57.600
What you've been looking for.

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:00.390
The Embryo!

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:03.640
Take it, I've brought it to you.

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:13.320
It's beautiful.

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:14.660
The Embryo

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:16.770
is mine.

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.130
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.510
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:50.810
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:53.050
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.000
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.330
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:05.890
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.660
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.270
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.640
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:20.550
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.800
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:27.800
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.050
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:35.030
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:39.730
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:47.890
Today, I'm number one!

00:23:47.890 --> 00:23:49.290
Of course!

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:52.900
The Golden Prince Shuraiya is in big trouble!

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:56.250
No, Shuraiya! That's not the Embryo! It's fake!

00:23:56.250 --> 00:24:00.350
Oh dear, he can't seem to hear your voice anymore.

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:04.010
This is bad, Amu-chan! At this rate, you won't be able to marry into money!

00:24:04.010 --> 00:24:06.640
What will we do if she can't become a queen?

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:10.180
Give me a break! This isn't the time for that!

00:24:10.180 --> 00:24:11.570
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.570 --> 00:24:13.110
The Golden Prince! Part Two.

00:24:13.110 --> 00:24:15.820
I get the feeling a new Guardian Character will be born!

00:24:15.820 --> 00:24:17.720
There sure will be a lot of us then.

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:19.640
Indeed!
